          "entities": {},
          "text": "In Trieste, the “Be comfortable in the uncomfortable” Convention reminded us that true entrepreneurial spirit is born from seeing change as an opportunity to seize together. In this meeting, we demonstrated that innovation springs from the courage to step forward and the will to turn every challenge into tangible value.\n\nBeing Fincantieri means believing in the strength of ideas, in our ability to evolve, and in respect for the values that have always guided us. Today, we celebrated our identity: a community that grows, renews itself, and looks ahead with determination.\n\nWe bring on board a new energy, certain that only united can we overcome every limit and continue to write the future of our industry."
